{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_VM8gqJVOGRqV4AsK0nllscl2","content":"readback/watch-notes.md:3:Intervals: LTHR 172. Watch (Forerunner 965): auto-detected LTHR 168, zones\nreadback/watch-notes.md:10:| step | planned (% LTHR) | expected on watch (× 172) | watch displayed |\nreadback/watch-notes.md:17:Every corridor shows up as one of the watch's own zone bands, not the range we\nreadback/watch-notes.md:18:planned. Changing the watch's LTHR to 172 moves the bands but they are still\nreadback/watch-notes.md:19:zone edges, never 151–160 or 129–141. Earlier tries: `units: \"bpm\"` with\nreadback/watch-notes.md:20:absolute values made the watch show 214–249 bpm; `start_bpm`/`end_bpm` made\ngen.py:11:    \"\"\"HR corridor for a step, as a percentage of the athlete's LTHR.\"\"\"\ngen.py:13:    return {\"units\": \"%lthr\", \"value\": lo, \"end\": hi}\nREADME.md:12:Athlete thresholds live in Intervals (LTHR 172 for this athlete). HR targets\nREADME.md:13:in plans are percentages of LTHR; Intervals converts them to bpm at export.\nreadback/event-184233-as-sent.json:11:          \"units\": \"%lthr\",\nreadback/event-184233-as-sent.json:23:              \"units\": \"%lthr\",\nreadback/event-184233-as-sent.json:32:              \"units\": \"%lthr\",\nreadback/event-184233-as-sent.json:43:          \"units\": \"%lthr\","}
